__CMP Completion__
ctrl+space  :open Completion
ctrl+e      :cancel completion


__Movement__

ctrl+i  :go forward
ctrl+o  :go back
grr     :rename symbol in current scope
gnd     :go to definition
gd      :move to local declaration
gD      :move to global declaration

ctrl+t  :move curser one tab


ib      :select inner block with ()
iB      :select inner block with {}

"xy     :yank to register x
"xp     :paste from register x

y'a     :yank from mark a

r!      :redirect command output into the buffer

__Diagnostics__
<c-w>d  :diagnostic on current line

__Colors__

:Inspect :To inspect the item under the cursor

CoC
['<C-b>'] = cmp.mapping.scroll_docs(-4),
['<C-f>'] = cmp.mapping.scroll_docs(4),
['<C-Space>'] = cmp.mapping.complete(),
['<C-e>'] = cmp.mapping.abort(),
['<CR>'] = cmp.mapping.confirm({ select = true }), -- Accept currently selected item. Set `select` to `false` to only confirm explicitly selected items.

__Leader Mappings (mapleader = " ")__

__File/Search__
<leader>f :Telescope find_files
<leader>g :Telescope live_grep
<leader>b :Telescope buffers
<leader>reg :Telescope registers
<leader>t :Telescope lsp_document_symbols (functions)
<leader>e :Telescope diagnostics
<leader>r :Telescope lsp_references

__Snippets__
<leader>s :Telescope ultisnips

__Harpoon__
<leader>a :add current file to harpoon list
<leader>h :open harpoon file picker

__Flash (jump to text)__
<leader>m :flash jump

__ZenMode__
<leader>z :ZenMode

__Other__
<leader>* :search and replace word under cursor in whole file

