__Window Navigation__
Alt+h :move to left window
Alt+j :move to lower window
Alt/k :move to upper window
Alt+l :move to right window

__Line/Buffer Movement__
Ctrl+j :move line down
Ctrl+k :move line up
Ctrl+i :go forward (jump to location mark)
Ctrl+o :go back (jump from location mark)
Ctrl+t :move cursor one tab forward

__Definition/Declaration__
gd :go to local definition
gD :go to global definition
grr :rename symbol in current scope (LSP)

__Text Object__
ib :select inner block ()
iB :select inner block {}
"xy :yank to register x
"xp :paste from register x
y'a :yank from mark a
r! :redirect command output into buffer

__Diagnostics__
<c-w>d :diagnostic on current line

__Colors/Inspection__
:Inspect :inspect item under cursor

__Completion (nvim-cmp)__
Ctrl+Space :open completion
Ctrl+e :cancel completion
Ctrl+b :scroll docs up
Ctrl+f :scroll docs down
Tab :confirm completion (or fallback)
S-Tab :jump backward in UltiSnips
CR :confirm selected item

__UltiSnips__
Tab :expand snippet / jump forward
S-Tab :jump backward
